  "body": "A rare opportunity in Takapuna offering flexible dual-key living with impressive sea and city views.\r\n\r\nDesigned as two self-contained living spaces within one property, this clever configuration provides exceptional flexibility for extended family, guests, working from home or buyers looking for additional income potential.\r\n\r\nThe main residence features two generous bedrooms, an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, bathroom and a fantastic 6.9m-long balcony - the perfect position to take in the outlook.\r\n\r\nThe separate one-bedroom residence has its own kitchen, bathroom and living area, creating genuine separation and privacy.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- Highly sought-after Takapuna location\r\n- Flexible dual-key configuration\r\n- Sea & city views\r\n- Main residence with 2 generous bedrooms\r\n- Separate self-contained 1-bedroom residence\r\n- Two kitchens, two bathrooms & two living areas\r\n- Large 6.9m balcony\r\n- Dedicated car park\r\n- Ideal for extended family or guests\r\n- Potential to live in one and rent the other\r\n- Excellent option for investors seeking flexibility\r\n- Easy access to Takapuna, motorway connections & the CBD\r\n- Excellent local school zones including Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Belmont Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School & Westlake Girls' High School\r\n\r\nTwo spaces. One address. An incredibly flexible way to own in Takapuna.\r\n\r\nContact Mitchell Eades today to arrange a private viewing\r\n021 255 8573",
